%% Implemented single assistant runtime; see ../../ARCHITECTURE.md.
flowchart TD
  USER[User request] --> SESSION[Conversation session]
  SESSION --> RUN[One cancellable run and shared budgets]
  RUN --> CTX[Assemble instructions, history, memory and permitted schemas]
  CTX --> MODEL[Shared model client and selected provider]
  MODEL --> RESPONSE{Structured response}
  RESPONSE -->|ordinary tool calls| GATE[Validate, authorize, bind, approve, revalidate]
  GATE --> TOOLS[Files, commands, desktop, web, MCP]
  TOOLS --> EVIDENCE[Workflow evidence and project checks]
  EVIDENCE --> CTX
  RESPONSE -->|optional consultation| SPECIALIST[Sequential specialist on same model and budget]
  SPECIALIST -->|research web calls| GATE
  SPECIALIST -->|bounded findings| CTX
  RESPONSE -->|optional checkpoint| CHECKPOINT[Coding session state]
  CHECKPOINT --> CTX
  RESPONSE -->|answer| VERIFY[Assess completion against evidence]
  VERIFY -->|repair within budget| CTX
  VERIFY -->|final progress and limits| SAVE[Persist result and finish run]
  SAVE --> UI[Chat or shortcut]
